Third-party content under repos/
--------------------------------

Each subdirectory under repos/ contains a snapshot of a third-party
Rewst-related repository pulled from its public GitHub source. The original
license and authorship of each snapshot are preserved within that subdirectory
(look for the snapshot's own LICENSE, COPYING, or README files).

The EGI MIT License at the repository root does NOT supersede the license of
any snapshot under repos/. Users redistributing any snapshot must honor that
snapshot's original license terms and attribution requirements.

Removal and re-attribution requests
-----------------------------------

If you are the author of a snapshotted repository and would like it removed
from this catalog, re-attributed, or updated, please open an issue on this
repository or contact EGI directly. EGI will respond promptly.
